OL,3,GNEWSAJudge reviewing trial of the facts
OL,4,Awill assess if victims are 'being
OL,5,Asidelined'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former senior judge who is carrying
OL,8,Fout a review of the legal framework on
OL,9,Ftrial of the facts cases in Northern
OL,10,FIreland has said he wants to look into
OL,11,Fwhether victims are "being sidelined".
OL,13,FSir John Gillen, who led a major review
OL,14,Fof sexual offence trials in 2019, is
OL,15,Fexpected to deliver an interim report
OL,16,Fby February 2027.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
