OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAJudge reviewing trial of the facts
OL,4,Awill assess if victims are 'being
OL,5,Asidelined'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes after Eleanor Donaldson, wife
OL,8,Fof convicted sex offender Jeffrey
OL,9,FDonaldson, faced a trial of the facts
OL,10,Fafter being found unfit for a
OL,11,Fconventional trial on mental health
OL,12,Fgrounds.
OL,14,FSir John said he will also explore what
OL,15,Fhappens in a case when a defendant
OL,16,Flater "becomes fit" after being deemed
OL,17,Funfit to stand trial.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
